nordstjernen (1.0.10-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Replace the vendored miniaudio audio backend with SDL2 output plus the
    minimp3 MP3 decoder, removing ~93k lines of vendored source.
  * Link libm into the nordstjernen-audio helper on all platforms (fixes the
    BSD link failure).

