nordstjernen (1.0.9-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging (Closes: #NNNNNN).
  * Targets the non-free component: the NSL-1.0 license is not DFSG-free.
  * Built with -Dai=disabled (drops the llama.cpp CMake subproject, the only
    build-time network dependency) and -Dqt=disabled.

